# Local `npm run dev` needs nothing: it runs on demo data in the browser.
# `npm run dev:server` runs the real API locally on an in-memory Postgres (PGlite).
#
# On Vercel (set under Settings → Environment Variables):
#   DATABASE_URL           set automatically when a Neon database is connected (Storage → Neon)
#   ADMIN_SETUP_PASSWORD   password for the first Super Admins (angel, philips); used only while none exists
#   ADMIN_SETUP_USERS      optional, default "angel,philips"
